<title>THAILAND: One Holding has debts of 7.018 billion.</title>
<headline>One Holding has debts of 7.018 billion.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-03-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thailand's One Holding Plc owes lenders 7.018 billion baht ($2.7 billion), the company said in a statement to the Stock Exchange of Thailand on Friday.</p>
<p>The firm has loans totalling 4.956 billion baht outstanding to 38 financial institutions, owes 562 million on its convertible debentures and a further 1.5 billion on debentures, the statement said.</p>
